investments","dcf_model_ev":4853.8,"ev_to_ebitda":25.2,"debt_to_ebitda":0.1,"net_debt_to_ebitda":-1.99,"f_score":9,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 11.3%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $290M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 33.3%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 2.07"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":31.9,"default_fair_val":31.9,"premium_pct":28.7,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":44.9,"pe_forward":39.5,"pb_trailing":7.6,"pb_forward":6.8,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":5.9,"fcf_to_ev":4.54,"fcf_to_mcap":4.21,"liab_to_assets":33.3,"cash_to_assets":39.1,"current_ratio":2.07,"roe":17,"roa":11.3,"moat":{"ticker":"GLBE","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Global-e Online 的品牌定價權相對較弱，主要體現在其作為跨境電商解決方案提供商的角色。其價值在於提供技術和服務，而非擁有強勢的終端品牌。雖然能為商家提升銷售額，但定價能力主要受制於合作商家及其產品的市場接受度。與擁有強大品牌忠誠度和議價能力的消費品公司相比，Global-e 的定價權壁壘不夠堅固。其競爭優勢更多來自於服務的效率和整合能力，而非品牌溢價。因此，在品牌定價權方面，給予中等偏上的評分。","comment_en":"Global-e Online's brand pricing power is relatively weak, primarily stemming from its role as a cross-border e-commerce solution provider. Its value lies in offering technology and services rather than owning strong end-consumer brands. While it can boost sales for merchants, its pricing power is largely dictated by the market acceptance of its partner merchants and their products. Compared to companies with strong brand loyalty and pricing power, Global-e's pricing power barrier is not sufficiently robust. Its competitive advantage comes more from service efficiency and integration capabilities than brand premium. Therefore, a moderate to high score is assigned for brand pricing power."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Global-e Online 在專利和監管壁壘方面具有一定的優勢，但並非其核心競爭力。公司在跨境支付、合規性處理和物流整合方面擁有專利技術，這有助於其提供無縫的客戶體驗。然而，這些專利並非像製藥公司那樣具有絕對的壟斷性，技術迭代和競爭對手模仿的可能性依然存在。監管環境的變化也可能影響其業務，但公司在合規方面的經驗和能力可以視為一種緩衝。總體而言，專利和監管壁壘提供了一定的保護，但不足以構成極高的進入門檻。","comment_en":"Global-e Online possesses some advantages in patents and regulatory barriers, though they are not its core competitive strength. The company holds patented technologies in cross-border payments, compliance handling, and logistics integration, which contribute to a seamless customer experience. However, these patents are not as absolutely monopolistic as those in the pharmaceutical industry, and the possibility of technological iteration and imitation by competitors remains. Changes in the regulatory environment could also affect its business, but the company's experience and capabilities in compliance can serve as a buffer. Overall, patent and regulatory barriers offer some protection but are not sufficient to constitute an extremely high entry barrier."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Global-e Online 在轉換成本方面建立了相當堅固的壁壘。一旦商家選擇 Global-e 作為其跨境電商解決方案，整合其支付、物流、合規和本地化服務將涉及複雜的系統調整和數據遷移。重新選擇供應商不僅會帶來高昂的技術和人力成本，還可能影響現有客戶的購物體驗和銷售數據，進而損害品牌聲譽。這種深度整合和對營運流程的依賴，使得商家在轉換時面臨顯著的阻力，為 Global-e 提供了穩定的客戶基礎和可觀的客戶留存率。","comment_en":"Global-e Online has established a considerably robust barrier in terms of switching costs. Once a merchant chooses Global-e as its cross-border e-commerce solution, integrating its payment, logistics, compliance, and localization services involves complex system adjustments and data migration. Selecting a new vendor would not only incur significant technical and human resource costs but could also impact the existing customer shopping experience and sales data, thereby damaging brand reputation. This deep integration and reliance on operational processes create significant resistance for merchants when switching, providing Global-e with a stable customer base and a respectable customer retention rate."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Global-e Online 的網絡效應體現在其連接商家與全球消費者的能力上。隨著越來越多的商家加入 Global-e 的平台，其服務對消費者的吸引力也隨之增加，因為消費者可以通過一個統一的平台購買來自全球的商品。同時，更多的商家也意味著 Global-e 能與更多物流和支付提供商建立合作關係，進一步優化其服務。這種商家與消費者之間的雙邊網絡效應，雖然不如社交媒體平台那樣直接，但確實增強了平台的價值和競爭壁壘。","comment_en":"Global-e Online's network effects are manifested in its ability to connect merchants with global consumers. As more merchants join the Global-e platform, its services become more attractive to consumers, who can purchase goods from around the world through a unified platform. Simultaneously, a larger merchant base also means Global-e can establish more partnerships with logistics and payment providers, further optimizing its services. This two-sided network effect between merchants and consumers, while not as direct as in social media platforms, does enhance the platform's value and competitive barrier."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Global-e Online 透過規模經濟實現了顯著的成本優勢。隨著交易量的增加，公司能夠與支付處理商、物流公司和貨幣兌換服務商協商到更優惠的價格。這種規模化的採購能力降低了單位交易成本，並使其能夠為商家提供更具競爭力的價格。此外，其技術平台的規模化部署也攤薄了研發和維護成本。這種成本結構上的優勢，使得 Global-e 能夠在價格上與競爭對手抗衡，並為其帶來更高的利潤率，形成一道難以被小型競爭者跨越的門檻。","comment_en":"Global-e Online achieves significant cost advantages through economies of scale. As transaction volumes increase, the company can negotiate more favorable rates with payment processors, logistics providers, and currency exchange services. This scaled procurement capability reduces per-unit transaction costs and allows it to offer more competitive pricing to merchants. Furthermore, the scaled deployment of its technology platform also amortizes research, development, and maintenance costs. This cost structure advantage enables Global-e to compete on price with rivals and achieve higher profit margins, creating a barrier that is difficult for smaller competitors to overcome."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Global-e Online 的獨特地理資產並非其核心競爭優勢。公司業務遍及全球，但其優勢在於技術平台和服務網絡，而非特定地理位置的固定資產或資源。雖然其全球佈局使其能夠服務於不同市場，但這種廣泛性也意味著其在任何單一地區的市場主導地位並不突出。與擁有稀缺礦產、獨特土地或特定區域市場壟斷的公司相比，Global-e 的地理資產壁壘相對較弱，其價值更多體現在其服務的可及性和覆蓋範圍上。","comment_en":"Global-e Online's unique geographical assets are not its core competitive advantage. The company operates globally, but its strengths lie in its technology platform and service network, rather than fixed assets or resources in specific geographical locations. While its global presence allows it to serve various markets, this breadth also means its market dominance in any single region is not pronounced. Compared to companies owning scarce mineral resources, unique land, or monopolizing specific regional markets, Global-e's geographical asset barrier is relatively weak; its value is more reflected in the accessibility and coverage of its services."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Global-e Online 在營運效率方面表現出色，這構成了其重要的經濟護城河。公司透過優化支付流程、簡化物流配送、自動化合規審核以及提供本地化客戶服務，顯著降低了跨境電商的複雜性和成本。其技術平台能夠高效處理大量交易，並確保順暢的客戶體驗。這種高度自動化和標準化的營運模式，不僅提高了盈利能力，也使得競爭對手難以在效率和成本上匹敵，尤其是在處理複雜的國際貿易規則和支付系統時。","comment_en":"Global-e Online demonstrates excellent operational efficiency, which constitutes a significant economic moat. By optimizing payment processes, streamlining logistics, automating compliance checks, and providing localized customer service, the company significantly reduces the complexity and cost of cross-border e-commerce. Its technology platform can efficiently handle large volumes of transactions and ensure a smooth customer experience. This highly automated and standardized operational model not only enhances profitability but also makes it difficult for competitors to match its efficiency and cost-effectiveness, especially when dealing with complex international trade regulations and payment systems."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Global-e Online 的資本配置能力值得肯定，儘管其仍處於成長階段。公司將資本主要投入於技術研發、平台擴張和市場拓展，以鞏固其市場地位和擴大網絡效應。其穩健的現金流和較低的負債水平為其提供了靈活的資本配置空間。管理層在追求增長的同時，也注重維持健康的財務狀況。雖然尚未像成熟企業那樣展現出極致的資本配置藝術，但其成長導向的配置策略在當前階段是適當且有效的，為長期價值創造奠定了基礎。","comment_en":"Global-e Online's capital allocation capability is commendable, although it is still in its growth phase. The company primarily invests capital in technology R&D, platform expansion, and market development to solidify its market position and enhance network effects. Its strong cash flow and low debt levels provide it with flexibility in capital allocation. While pursuing growth, management also focuses on maintaining a healthy financial position. Although it has not yet demonstrated the ultimate art of capital allocation like mature companies, its growth-oriented allocation strategy is appropriate and effective at this stage, laying the foundation for long-term value creation."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Global-e Online 在客戶留存方面表現優異，這得益於其高轉換成本和卓越的服務品質。一旦商家深度整合了 Global-e 的解決方案，他們將面臨較高的轉換成本，這自然提高了客戶留存率。此外，Global-e 持續提供穩定、高效且符合當地法規的跨境電商服務，確保了商家的銷售順暢和客戶體驗的良好。這種對服務品質的堅持，使得客戶黏性極高，進一步鞏固了公司的市場地位，並為其帶來可預測的經常性收入。","comment_en":"Global-e Online excels in customer retention, thanks to its high switching costs and excellent service quality. Once merchants deeply integrate Global-e's solutions, they face significant switching costs, which naturally leads to a high customer retention rate. Furthermore, Global-e consistently provides stable, efficient, and compliant cross-border e-commerce services, ensuring smooth sales for merchants and a positive customer experience. This commitment to service quality results in extremely high customer stickiness, further solidifying the company's market position and providing predictable recurring revenue."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Global-e Online 的業務模式具有相當的持久性，但面臨持續的技術變革和市場競爭壓力。其核心業務——為商家提供跨境電商解決方案，滿足了全球化趨勢下的持續需求。然而，電子商務和支付技術的快速發展意味著公司需要不斷創新以保持領先地位。雖然其建立的轉換成本和網絡效應提供了一定的穩定性，但來自新興技術和競爭對手的挑戰始終存在。其持久性在於其適應性和持續優化服務的能力，而非某種不可動搖的壟斷地位。","comment_en":"Global-e Online's business model possesses considerable durability, but it faces ongoing technological changes and market competition. Its core business of providing cross-border e-commerce solutions meets a continuous demand driven by globalization trends. However, the rapid evolution of e-commerce and payment technologies means the company must constantly innovate to stay ahead. While its established switching costs and network effects provide a degree of stability, challenges from emerging technologies and competitors are ever-present. Its durability lies in its adaptability and ability to continuously optimize services, rather than an unshakeable monopolistic position."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Global-e Online 在跨境電商解決方案領域建立了一個以高轉換成本、網絡效應和營運效率為核心的經濟護城河。其平台深度整合了支付、物流與合規服務，使得商家轉換成本高昂，客戶留存率穩健。規模經濟帶來了成本優勢，使其能提供具競爭力的價格。儘管品牌定價權和專利壁壘相對較弱，且非傳統意義上的地理資產，但其強大的營運效率和持續的技術投入，使其在快速變化的市場中保持領先。整體而言，Global-e 展現出類似「收費橋」的特徵，連接了全球買賣雙方，並從中獲取穩定費用，具備相當的長期價值投資潛力。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Global-e Online has established an economic moat in the cross-border e-commerce solutions sector, centered around high switching costs, network effects, and operational efficiency. Its platform deeply integrates payment, logistics, and compliance services, making it costly for merchants to switch and ensuring robust customer retention. Economies of scale provide cost advantages, enabling competitive pricing. While brand pricing power and patent barriers are relatively weaker, and it lacks traditional geographical assets, its strong operational efficiency and continuous technological investment keep it ahead in a rapidly evolving market. Overall, Global-e exhibits characteristics of a 'toll bridge,' connecting global buyers and sellers and earning stable fees, possessing considerable long-term value investment potential.","evidenceHash":"350298d67ca53226215f306f2074cef2f34c405409c6e9137a05995b5b37c9da","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Gemini"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"350298d67ca53226215f306f2074cef2f34c405409c6e9137a05995b5b37c9da","currentEvidenceHash":"350298d67ca53226215f306f2074cef2f34c405409c6e9137a05995b5b37c9da"},"fScore":{"score":9,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-13T07:47:42.595Z","evidenceHash":"d03f96bd79d3044320bcd3284758857930e2932766602a459f3027a58288b855"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-13T07:47:42.595Z","evidenceHash":"d03f96bd79d3044320bcd3284758857930e2932766602a459f3027a58288b855"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/GLBE.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/GLBE.png","website":"https://www.global-e.com","ceo":"Amir Schlachet","full_time_employees":"1219","description":"Global-E Online Ltd., along with its affiliated companies, operates a technology platform specifically designed to facilitate and expedite direct-to-consumer international online sales. This system enables businesses to effectively reach a worldwide customer base and simplifies the process for global shoppers to purchase goods from merchants located anywhere in the world. The company's operations encompass major regions such as Israel, the United Kingdom, and the United States, in addition to its extensive international presence. Global-E was founded in 2013 and maintains its primary corporate office in Petah Tikva, Israel.","description_en":"Global-E Online Ltd., along with its affiliated companies, operates a technology platform specifically design